{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>And to half the tribe of Menashe.</b> The sons of Menashe did not ask for themselves an inheritance in the land of Sihon and Og; only the sons of Reuven and Gad asked. But because their father caused the tribes to tear their garments in the incident of the goblet, he was given his inheritance in two portions, on both sides of the Jordan."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:20:29.326182358Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}